--- a/docs/templates.rst
+++ b/docs/templates.rst
@@ -1693,6 +1693,21 @@ To bind more than one expression, separate each with a comma (``,``).
 To pluralize, specify both the singular and plural forms separated by
 the ``pluralize`` tag.
 
+A translation context can be given as a string literal immediately after
+``trans``. Contextual singular messages use ``pgettext``, while
+contextual plural messages use ``npgettext``. The context is part of
+the extracted message and is not evaluated during rendering.
+
+.. code-block:: jinja
+
+    {% trans "navigation" %}Open{% endtrans %}
+
+    {% trans "search" count=results|length %}
+        {{ count }} result
+    {% pluralize %}
+        {{ count }} results
+    {% endtrans %}
+
 .. code-block:: jinja
 
     {% trans count=list|length %}
